Cryptographic primitives used:
- X25519 (RFC 7748) — key agreement for sealed identity + transport
- Ed25519 (RFC 8032) — signing for identity + offline data-pack integrity
- age (age-encryption.org) — sealed envelope format
- BLAKE3 — hashing / MAC

